  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-07T14:33:15.732Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "https://forum.unity.com/threads/mouse-input-issues-framerate-dependence-weirdness.109694/\nhttps://forum.unity.com/threads/input-and-time-deltatime.293928/\nhttps://sleepygamersmemo.blogspot.com/2017/08/unity-mouse-input.html\nThis is probably the problem I'm still concerned about, but I think it's probably this issue.\nIf you are using Time.deltaTime as the VRC mouse input, please remove it.\nDon't use Time.deltaTime for any mouse input.",
